// The 2006 crossbows and bolts, imported from the rev 474 cache by tools/models/import474.py (models
// byte for byte, recoloured per metal as 474 had them). The combat numbers are OSRS's, which are
// the same items: levelrequire is both the Ranged level to wield and the bolt tier a crossbow can
// fire (skill_combat/scripts/player/player_ranged.rs2). Enchanted bolts' effects are
// skill_combat/scripts/player/bolt_effects.rs2.

